      "message": "gic_probe_pkvm_redist keeps walking after gic_pkvm_early_redists is full, so on a system with more redistributors than NR_CPUS the extras are dropped with no warning, and never get registered for emulation or deprivileged.\n\nCould that be a WARN and an error return rather than a silent skip?",
