      "writtenOn": "2026-07-31T08:08:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This only looks for the \"arm,gic-v3\" DT node, so on ACPI it returns -ENODEV and the whole GICR hardening is skipped. Not an issue for the platforms we care about today, but for a hardening series I would rather it failed loudly than came up without the protection.\n\nIs ACPI something you want to handle here, or should it refuse to boot protected?",
      "revId": "c9223f9535911a698deadec41f3d8d022c9f5d20",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
